  - Id: dbb_react
    Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: edfbeac3d87c4bb78f6e69d03c5a4fcb, type: 2}
    DialogueText: Ah, yes, buzzing. Can't believe it. You are an absolute legend.
      Right then... yep, I'll let you know what's going on.
    Choices:
    - ChoiceText: Go on then.
      NextNodeId: dbb_reveal1
      QuestGate: 0
      QuestGateId: 
      QuestGateStage: 0
      RequiredStat: 
      RequiredStatLevel: 0
      RequiredItem: {fileID: 0}
      RequiredItemQuantity: 1
      ConsumeRequiredItem: 0
      GrantQuestId: 
      GrantQuestTitle: 
      GrantQuestObjective: 
      GrantQuestLocation: 
      TeachSpark: 0
      CompleteQuestId: 
      Merchant: {fileID: 0}
      MerchantAction: 0
      HireCompanionId: 
      HireCompanionFree: 0
      CompanionCommand: 0
  - Id: dbb_reveal1
    Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: edfbeac3d87c4bb78f6e69d03c5a4fcb, type: 2}
    DialogueText: So, Councillor Mosley's been doing a few dodgy dealings. I saw
      him talking to Ralph and Sanjeet from the Spartans, and he was buying a box
      of these weird looking vapes.
    Choices:
    - ChoiceText: Uh, right.
      NextNodeId: dbb_reveal2
      QuestGate: 0
      QuestGateId: 
      QuestGateStage: 0
      RequiredStat: 
      RequiredStatLevel: 0
      RequiredItem: {fileID: 0}
      RequiredItemQuantity: 1
      ConsumeRequiredItem: 0
      GrantQuestId: 
      GrantQuestTitle: 
      GrantQuestObjective: 
      GrantQuestLocation: 
      TeachSpark: 0
      CompleteQuestId: 
      Merchant: {fileID: 0}
      MerchantAction: 0
      HireCompanionId: 
      HireCompanionFree: 0
      CompanionCommand: 0
  - Id: dbb_reveal2
    Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: edfbeac3d87c4bb78f6e69d03c5a4fcb, type: 2}
    DialogueText: The boxes had these weird Chinese letters on. Shanghai and all
      that jazz. So I assume it's some sort of weird import. I'm guessing that's
      got something to do with the vapes, because I ain't seen them anywhere else
      before, and they're the only characters shady enough to get involved with the
      Chinese at the minute.
    Choices:
    - ChoiceText: Fuckin' hell.
      NextNodeId: dbb_reveal3
      QuestGate: 0
      QuestGateId: 
      QuestGateStage: 0
      RequiredStat: 
      RequiredStatLevel: 0
      RequiredItem: {fileID: 0}
      RequiredItemQuantity: 1
      ConsumeRequiredItem: 0
      GrantQuestId: 
      GrantQuestTitle: 
      GrantQuestObjective: 
      GrantQuestLocation: 
      TeachSpark: 0
      CompleteQuestId: 
      Merchant: {fileID: 0}
      MerchantAction: 0
      HireCompanionId: 
      HireCompanionFree: 0
      CompanionCommand: 0
  - Id: dbb_reveal3
    Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: edfbeac3d87c4bb78f6e69d03c5a4fcb, type: 2}
    DialogueText: You should hit up that little trap house out in the north. You
      might get some answers from them, but I dunno. They ain't always there.
    Choices:
    - ChoiceText: Yeah, okay. Right, whatever. Sound. I'll go speak to Daniel Paul's.
